# Markov Chain

A Markov chain is a type of [Stochastic Process](stochastic_process.dj) that describes a sequence of possible events in which the probability of each event depends only on the state attained in the previous event. 
This is known as the *Markov property*.

## Mathematical Definition

If we want to understand its rigorous foundations, we must look deeply into [Probability Theory](probability.dj).

```python
# A simple representation of a transition matrix
transition_matrix = [
    [0.9, 0.1],
    [0.5, 0.5]
]
```